{
  "info": {
    "name": "jungle",
    "description": "Colecao completa da API jungle.\n\nCOMO USAR, NA ORDEM:\n\n1. Suba o ambiente: docker compose up --build\n2. Pasta '1. Autenticacao': rode as tres requisicoes de token. Cada uma guarda o token numa variavel da colecao automaticamente (tokenInternal, tokenProviderA, tokenProviderB). Os tokens expiram em 5 minutos: quando algo responder 401, rode a requisicao de token de novo.\n3. Pasta '2. Health': nao precisa de token, sao publicas.\n4. Pasta '3. Carteira': 'Abrir carteira' guarda walletId e playerId automaticamente. Rode ela antes das demais.\n5. Pasta '4. Operacoes': BET/WIN/LOSS/REFUND/ROLLBACK. O BET guarda o externalId dele, que o REFUND e o ROLLBACK reutilizam como referencia.\n6. Pasta '5. Cenarios': casos que demonstram idempotencia, conflito, saldo insuficiente, isolamento entre provedores e reversao duplicada.\n\nAs variaveis sao da colecao, entao nao e preciso configurar Environment.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "keycloakUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "realm", "value": "jungle", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tokenInternal", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tokenProviderA", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tokenProviderB", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "walletId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "playerId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "betExternalId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "betTransactionId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "winExternalId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ledgerCursor", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autenticacao",
      "description": "Obtem os tokens no Keycloak pelo fluxo client_credentials. Cada requisicao guarda o access_token numa variavel da colecao.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Token - servico interno",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenInternal', body.access_token);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('token recebido', () => pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "",
                  "const claims = JSON.parse(atob(body.access_token.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/')));",
                  "console.log('papel :', claims.realm_access.roles);",
                  "console.log('aud   :', claims.aud);",
                  "console.log('expira em', body.expires_in, 'segundos');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "jungle-internal" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "internal-secret" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": ["{{keycloakUrl}}"],
              "path": ["realms", "{{realm}}", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Identidade do servico interno da plataforma. Papel 'internal-service': pode abrir carteiras, ler qualquer carteira e reconciliar. NAO tem provider_id, entao nao age como provedor nenhum."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Token - provider-a",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenProviderA', body.access_token);",
                  "",
                  "const claims = JSON.parse(atob(body.access_token.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/')));",
                  "console.log('papel       :', claims.realm_access.roles);",
                  "console.log('provider_id :', claims.provider_id);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('claim provider_id presente', () => pm.expect(claims.provider_id).to.eql('provider-a'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "provider-a" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "provider-a-secret" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": ["{{keycloakUrl}}"],
              "path": ["realms", "{{realm}}", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Provedor de jogo A. Papel 'provider' e claim provider_id=provider-a. So pode enviar e ler operacoes proprias. A API decide o provedor autorizado POR ESTE CLAIM, nunca pelo campo providerId do corpo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Token - provider-b",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenProviderB', body.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "provider-b" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "provider-b-secret" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": ["{{keycloakUrl}}"],
              "path": ["realms", "{{realm}}", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Provedor B. Existe para demonstrar o isolamento: ele nao consegue ler nada do provider-a."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Health e metricas",
      "description": "Rotas publicas: nao exigem token. Um probe que precisasse de credencial nao conseguiria distinguir 'o servico caiu' de 'o IdP caiu'.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liveness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health/live", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health", "live"] },
            "description": "Responde 200 se o processo esta de pe. Nao toca em nenhuma dependencia de proposito."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health/ready", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health", "ready"] },
            "description": "Responde 200 apenas se Postgres e SQS respondem. 503 com o detalhe de qual falhou, caso contrario."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Metricas (Prometheus)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/metrics", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["metrics"] },
            "description": "Procure por jungle_wager_transaction_results_total, jungle_duplicate_operations_total, jungle_outbox_lag_seconds, jungle_reconciliation_divergences_total."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Carteira",
      "description": "Operacoes de carteira sao restritas ao servico interno. Rode 'Abrir carteira' primeiro: ela guarda walletId e playerId para as demais requisicoes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Abrir carteira",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('novoPlayerId', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('walletId', body.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('playerId', body.playerId);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('criada com 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('versao comeca em 1', () => pm.expect(body.version).to.eql(1));",
                  "console.log('walletId:', body.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenInternal}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"playerId\": \"{{novoPlayerId}}\",\n  \"initialBalance\": { \"amount\": \"1000.00\", \"currency\": \"BRL\" }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallets", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["wallets"] },
            "description": "Cria a carteira. Com saldo positivo, o MESMO commit grava: a carteira, uma transacao OPENING ja PROCESSED, o lancamento de credito no extrato e dois eventos na outbox.\n\nO valor deve ter exatamente duas casas decimais: '1000' ou '1000.5' sao recusados com 400, sem arredondamento."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar carteira",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenInternal}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wallets", "{{walletId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Saldo e versao atuais. A versao sobe 1 a cada movimentacao de saldo (e so nelas: um LOSS nao mexe nela)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Extrato (ledger)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.nextCursor) { pm.collectionVariables.set('ledgerCursor', body.nextCursor); }",
                  "console.log('lancamentos nesta pagina:', body.entries.length);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenInternal}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wallets", "{{walletId}}", "ledger"],
              "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "10" }]
            },
            "description": "Historico append-only. Cada linha traz direcao, valor e o saldo antes e depois. Se vier nextCursor, ele fica salvo para a requisicao 'Extrato - proxima pagina'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Extrato - proxima pagina",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenInternal}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=10&cursor={{ledgerCursor}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wallets", "{{walletId}}", "ledger"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" },
                { "key": "cursor", "value": "{{ledgerCursor}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "O cursor e opaco (base64 do par created_at+id). Paginacao estavel: novos lancamentos no fim nao embaralham as paginas ja vistas."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reconciliacao",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('saldo bate com o extrato', () => pm.expect(body.consistent).to.be.true);",
                  "console.log('guardado :', body.storedBalance.amount);",
                  "console.log('calculado:', body.calculatedBalance.amount);",
                  "console.log('diferenca:', body.difference.amount);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenInternal}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wallets", "{{walletId}}", "reconciliation"]
            },
            "description": "Reconstroi o saldo somando creditos menos debitos do extrato e compara com o saldo guardado. NAO corrige nada: divergencia e reportada na resposta, no log e numa metrica."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Operacoes",
      "description": "Os cinco tipos que um provedor pode enviar. Todas exigem o header Idempotency-Key. Rode na ordem: o BET guarda o proprio externalId, que o REFUND e o ROLLBACK usam como referencia.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "BET (debito)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('betExternalId', 'bet-' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('betTransactionId', body.transactionId);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('processada', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('PROCESSED'));",
                  "pm.test('nao e replay', () => pm.expect(body.idempotentReplay).to.be.false);",
                  "console.log('saldo apos a aposta:', body.balance.amount);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenProviderA}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "provider-a:{{betExternalId}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"providerId\": \"provider-a\",\n  \"externalTransactionId\": \"{{betExternalId}}\",\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"walletId\": \"{{walletId}}\",\n  \"roundId\": \"round-1\",\n  \"gameId\": \"fortune-chimp\",\n  \"kind\": \"BET\",\n  \"money\": { \"amount\": \"25.00\", \"currency\": \"BRL\" }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wagering", "transactions"]
            },
            "description": "O jogador apostou: o dinheiro SAI da carteira. Exige valor positivo e saldo suficiente.\n\nO header Idempotency-Key e obrigatorio. O servidor nunca inventa uma chave no lugar de uma que faltou: responde 400."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "WIN (credito)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.collectionVariables.set('winExternalId', 'win-' + Date.now());"]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log('saldo apos o premio:', body.balance.amount);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenProviderA}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "provider-a:{{winExternalId}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"providerId\": \"provider-a\",\n  \"externalTransactionId\": \"{{winExternalId}}\",\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"walletId\": \"{{walletId}}\",\n  \"roundId\": \"round-1\",\n  \"gameId\": \"fortune-chimp\",\n  \"kind\": \"WIN\",\n  \"money\": { \"amount\": \"50.00\", \"currency\": \"BRL\" }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wagering", "transactions"]
            },
            "description": "O jogador ganhou: o dinheiro ENTRA. Pode opcionalmente informar referenceExternalTransactionId apontando para a aposta da mesma rodada (metadado informativo, nao bloqueia o pagamento)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "LOSS (nao move dinheiro)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.collectionVariables.set('lossExternalId', 'loss-' + Date.now());"]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('processada', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('PROCESSED'));",
                  "console.log('saldo inalterado:', body.balance.amount);",
                  "console.log('confira no extrato: o LOSS NAO gera lancamento');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenProviderA}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "provider-a:{{lossExternalId}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"providerId\": \"provider-a\",\n  \"externalTransactionId\": \"{{lossExternalId}}\",\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"walletId\": \"{{walletId}}\",\n  \"roundId\": \"round-2\",\n  \"gameId\": \"fortune-chimp\",\n  \"kind\": \"LOSS\",\n  \"money\": { \"amount\": \"0.00\", \"currency\": \"BRL\" }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wagering", "transactions"]
            },
            "description": "A rodada terminou sem premio. O dinheiro ja tinha saido no BET, entao aqui nao ha movimentacao: nenhum lancamento no extrato e a versao da carteira nao muda.\n\nExige amount exatamente '0.00'. Qualquer outro valor devolve 400."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "REFUND (estorna uma BET)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.collectionVariables.set('refundExternalId', 'refund-' + Date.now());"]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('processada', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('PROCESSED'));",
                  "console.log('saldo apos devolver a aposta:', body.balance.amount);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenProviderA}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "provider-a:{{refundExternalId}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"providerId\": \"provider-a\",\n  \"externalTransactionId\": \"{{refundExternalId}}\",\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"walletId\": \"{{walletId}}\",\n  \"roundId\": \"round-1\",\n  \"gameId\": \"fortune-chimp\",\n  \"kind\": \"REFUND\",\n  \"money\": { \"amount\": \"25.00\", \"currency\": \"BRL\" },\n  \"referenceExternalTransactionId\": \"{{betExternalId}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wagering", "transactions"]
            },
            "description": "Devolve integralmente o valor de uma BET ja processada. A referencia e obrigatoria, o valor tem que ser exatamente igual ao da aposta, e as duas precisam concordar em jogador, carteira, moeda e rodada.\n\nSe a BET referenciada ainda nao existir, a operacao fica em PENDING_REFERENCE (202) e um worker tenta de novo com backoff."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "ROLLBACK (desfaz uma operacao)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.collectionVariables.set('rollbackExternalId', 'rollback-' + Date.now());"]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log('status:', body.status, '| failureCode:', body.failureCode || '-');",
                  "if (body.status === 'REJECTED') {",
                  "  console.log('esperado se a BET ja foi estornada pelo REFUND: DUPLICATE_REVERSAL');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenProviderA}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "provider-a:{{rollbackExternalId}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"providerId\": \"provider-a\",\n  \"externalTransactionId\": \"{{rollbackExternalId}}\",\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"walletId\": \"{{walletId}}\",\n  \"roundId\": \"round-1\",\n  \"gameId\": \"fortune-chimp\",\n  \"kind\": \"ROLLBACK\",\n  \"money\": { \"amount\": \"50.00\", \"currency\": \"BRL\" },\n  \"referenceExternalTransactionId\": \"{{winExternalId}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wagering", "transactions"]
            },
            "description": "Desfaz uma BET, um WIN ou um REFUND ja processado, com o movimento contrario ao original. Aqui ele aponta para o WIN, entao DEBITA os 50.00 de volta.\n\nDiferenca para o REFUND: o REFUND so reverte BET e sempre credita; o ROLLBACK reverte tres tipos e a direcao depende do que esta desfazendo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar por id interno",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenProviderA}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions/{{betTransactionId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["wagering", "transactions", "{{betTransactionId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Consulta pelo id que a API gerou. Traz status, failureCode (se houver) e o saldo observado no processamento."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar por id do provedor",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenProviderA}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/providers/provider-a/wagering/transactions/{{betExternalId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["providers", "provider-a", "wagering", "transactions", "{{betExternalId}}"]
